cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this collection, cite it and the source paper of each skill you use (attribution.original_doi
  in every SKILL.md).
title: ASB Transcriptomics Skill Collection
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/HolobiomicsLab/asb-skills-transcriptomics
url: https://github.com/HolobiomicsLab/asb-skills-transcriptomics
abstract: 'Curated, evidence-grounded skill and software-tool collection for computational transcriptomics
  (bulk and single-cell RNA-seq analysis), generated by the AgenticScienceBuilder (ASB) pipeline from
  peer-reviewed method papers and their public code repositories. Each skill is anchored to verbatim evidence
  from its source paper, annotated with EDAM (Transcriptomics) and gated for licensing and personal data
  before release; the source paper of every skill is cited in its attribution block and must be cited
  alongside the collection. Released by the Holobiomics Lab (CNRS / Université Côte d''Azur). Source repositories:
  collection - https://github.com/HolobiomicsLab/asb-skills-transcriptomics; registry and tooling - https://github.com/HolobiomicsLab/asb-skill-collections;
  generating pipeline - https://github.com/HolobiomicsLab/AgenticScienceBuilder. Licence: collection content
  CC-BY-4.0; code Apache-2.0; verbatim quotes under quotation right (LICENSING.md).'
keywords:
- transcriptomics
- RNA-seq
- single-cell
- differential expression
- scientific agents
- agent skills
- EDAM
- AgenticScienceBuilder
authors:
