  given-names: Louis-Félix
  orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6711-6719
  affiliation: Holobiomics Lab, Institut de Chimie de Nice (ICN), CNRS UMR 7272 / Université Côte d'Azur
- name: AgenticScienceBuilder AI framework (from the scientific literature)
